<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Wednesday 110,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Wednesday 110,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wednesday's actual interior Iowa/southern Minnesota hog marketings matched the day's estimate of 110,000 head, USDA said. Opening trade not well established. Early sales Barrows and Gilts steady to $0.50 higher than midsession Wednesday.</p>
<p>				     Country		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs		 51.00 -52.50	   52.00 -53.50</p>
<p>liberal volume	    51.50 -52.50	   52.50 -53.50</p>
<p>few			   53.00		    54.00</p>
<p>Sows:   generally steady.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.     43.50 -46.00	   44.00 -46.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.		47.00 -48.00	   48.00 -49.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up		 50.00 -54.50	   52.00 -56.00</p>
<p>	  --Chicago newsdesk, 312-983-7347--</p>
